{"id":"b02c4619856f0f03","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Prokhorov Metric","display":"df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric — ZFC Measure7 Prokhorov Metric","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric — ZFC Measure7 Prokhorov Metric","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric — ZFC Measure7 Prokhorov Metric"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d)\">\\((X,d)\\)</span> (metric space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d\">\\(\\tau_d\\)</span> (metric topology) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)\\)</span> (its Borel sigma-algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\nu\">\\(\\mu,\\nu\\)</span> (Borel probability measures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in[0,1]\">\\(r\\in[0,1]\\)</span> (distance candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{\\varepsilon,d}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X\\mid\\exists a\\in A\\;(d(x,a)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\">\\(A^{\\varepsilon,d}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X\\mid\\exists a\\in A\\;(d(x,a)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}prokhorov\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}(r,\\mu,\\nu;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\nu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land r=\\inf\\left\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)\\;(\\mu(A)\\leq\\nu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon\\land\\nu(A)\\leq\\mu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}prokhorov\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}(r,\\mu,\\nu;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\nu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land r=\\inf\\left\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)\\;(\\mu(A)\\leq\\nu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon\\land\\nu(A)\\leq\\mu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The metric now depends on the ambient metric space and is restricted to Borel probability measures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{\\varepsilon,d}\">\\(A^{\\varepsilon,d}\\)</span> records its dependence on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S$ (metric-space predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"A^{\\varepsilon,d}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in X\\mid\\exists a\\in A\\;(d(x,a)<\\varepsilon)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}prokhorov\\text{-}metric} \\vdash \\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}(r,\\mu,\\nu;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\nu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d))\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land r=\\inf\\left\\{\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau_d)\\;(\\mu(A)\\leq\\nu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon\\land\\nu(A)\\leq\\mu(A^{\\varepsilon,d})+\\varepsilon)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A^{\\varepsilon,d}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false}],"bytes":1667,"backlinks":[{"id":"28af80b26dd4bae5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProkhorovDistance}$ is the metric-space-dependent Prokhorov-distance predicate (see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2639","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-prokhorov-metric]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97","5e0db065132180df","9375de7089953a2b"]}